"weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "66143197", "author": {"steamid": "76561198047297964", "personaname": "csoloTV", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198047297964/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 11160, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1419, "last_played": 1715660522, "avatar": "3f9ce7c86d315d326385ea05f1378a1525107e3d"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is definitely a strange game to look at. Yes, you are fighting armed frogs, giant insects, and space ships as some kind of infantry unit. Yes, this game involves some grinding and every level is 90% the same, survive the hordes of enemies. But that has to do with its true charm of being a simple game. \n\nThis game is simple to play and difficult to beat from facing multiple enemies charging in great numbers to its giant oversized bosses that will make you question who did more damage to the city, them or you. The voice acting you hear is completely hammy but you find yourself learning the troop songs and yelling \"EDF!!!\" whenever you beat the tough level. The classes are diverse enough but getting them all to beat each level becomes a real pain unless done in a group. \n\nBottom line is, there is a reason why this series has lasted beyond 2 generations of consoles with its normal game play style to alternate universe games of the same franchise. You won't find this game in MLG and its not a popular game to stream, but you don't have to look far in a gaming forum to find someone who has fond memories of this franchise and this game is definitely worth a try.", "timestamp_created": 1585551653, "timestamp_updated": 1585551653, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "66135847", "author": {"steamid": "76561198042488630", "personaname": "Efi", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/quotablequotes/", "num_games_owned": 711, "num_reviews": 32, "playtime_forever": 5598, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1363, "last_played": 1664486833, "avatar": "90c2465972d0a307b9d77453ea6146521dd72c60"}, "language": "english", "review": "its fun", "timestamp_created": 1585540800, "timestamp_updated": 1585540800, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "66114379", "author": {"steamid": "76561198965196617", "personaname": "fatunicorn", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198965196617/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 4789, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1998, "last_played": 1619386769, "avatar": "14f1a9927382fa8dea134a0f3ca6f17e6938e131"}, "language": "english", "review": "The only good bug, is a dead bug.\n\nI'm doing my part!", "timestamp_created": 1585513313, "timestamp_updated": 1585513313, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}]}